\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces End-to-end multimodal architecture of RespNews. Multilingual text representations (MuRIL) and visual feature extractions (EfficientNet-B0 / Xception) are unified via a Gated Multimodal Unit (GMU) and enriched over a heterogeneous GraphSAGE knowledge graph. Concurrently, a 23-technique rhetoric detector evaluates persuasion risk against the user's historical susceptibility profile. The responsible scoring engine balances multimodal relevance against persuasion risk under provider parity bounds, delivering a transparent feed with 100\% item-level explanations.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{2}{}{figure.1}{}}
